{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>&quot;TABLE GAME END&quot;</strong> is a nostalgic adventure game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3393090/extras/gte_store_616x158_001.png?t=1735286548\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u25c6 Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">After school, as always, I talk with <i>her</i> in the old school building.<br>We chat about the game she\u2019s making, or about the things happening in the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Through the window, the sunset paints the sky, and I can see someone playing in the schoolyard.<br>We just watch the scene or reminisce about old memories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Quiet, peaceful days pass by, without anything particularly eventful happening.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">But\u2026 <i>she</i> has already passed away.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3393090/extras/gte_store_616x158_002.png?t=1735286548\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u25c6 Game Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A walking simulator where various events unfold as you explore.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Progress the story by examining objects.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">No quest markers or time limits, allowing for a relaxed gameplay experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>She</i> wants to spend time with you.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Playtime:</strong> 10\u201330 minutes</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u25c6 Video Streaming Guidelines</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Streaming is allowed without prior permission for both individuals and organizations.</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"1","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3393090/7e4b4f3fc8fc3bdfa0d46